== Notes ==

*This spell is not directly available to casters; it is only available as a sub-spell of ''shadow conjuration'', ''greater shadow conjuration'', and ''shades''.
*The talk table entry for this spell indicates that early in the development of Neverwinter Nights, ''summon shadow'' was intended to be a level 5 [[cleric]] spell.

